{%- liquid
  # Same fixed ratio product-card.liquid pins its figure to ('natural' depends on a product's own media and has no
  # equivalent here, so it falls back to square): gives an image / video block an intrinsic card-sized height, so its
  # row doesn't collapse when it lands alone in a trailing row (no product card beside it to set the height).
  case settings.product_card_image_aspect_ratio
    when 'short', 'short_crop'
      assign promo_aspect_ratio = '4 / 3'
    when 'portrait', 'portrait_crop'
      assign promo_aspect_ratio = '4 / 5'
    when 'tall', 'tall_crop'
      assign promo_aspect_ratio = '2 / 3'
    else
      assign promo_aspect_ratio = '1'
  endcase
-%}

<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .product-list__promo .content-box {
    aspect-ratio: {{ promo_aspect_ratio }};
  }

  {%- comment -%}A video is wrapped in <video-media>, which sizes itself from the video's own ratio: here it fills the card, cropped with object-fit: cover, like an image{%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .product-list__promo .content-box__background-media video-media {
    aspect-ratio: auto;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: inherit;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .product-list:not(.product-list--carousel) {
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  {%- comment -%}
  From 700px theme.css makes the promo a grid container. Its single column is "auto", which can grow to fit
  its content: the content box's inline aspect-ratio plus height: 100% pushes that column wider than the
  card (height x ratio), so on desktop the image box was wider than the promo and its right side was
  clipped - the photo looked cut and pushed to the right. minmax(0, 1fr) pins the column to the card width.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .product-list__promo {
    grid-column: span 1;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    min-width: 0;
  }

  {%- comment -%}
  On mobile theme.css gives every promo (but the last) a negative bottom margin of (column gap - row gap) to
  stack full-width promos. Here the promo is one cell next to the cards, and that negative margin stretches
  it past its grid area, so it came out taller than the cards (by the difference between the row gap and the
  column gap) and the carousel's vertical overflow clip cut its rounded bottom corners square.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .product-list__promo:not(:last-child) {
    margin-block-end: 0;
  }

  {%- comment -%}
  width: 100% is needed next to height: 100%: the content box also has an inline aspect-ratio, and with a
  definite height and an auto width the browser derives the width from that ratio instead of filling the
  card, so the box (and its image) came out wider than the promo and got clipped on the right - off-center
  image and square right corners.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .product-list__promo .content-box {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--product-card-border-radius, 0);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .product-list__promo .content-box__background-media,
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .product-list__promo .content-box__background-media img {
    position: absolute !important;
    inset: 0;
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--product-card-border-radius, 0);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
    --product-list-column-count: {{ section.settings.products_per_row_mobile | times: 1 }};
  }

  {%- comment -%}
  Spacing between cards is intentionally NOT a per-section setting here - .product-list (theme.css)
  already reads column-gap/row-gap from --product-list-column-gap/--product-list-row-gap, which are
  computed globally from the theme's own "Product listing" > Spacing setting (css-variables.liquid),
  same as every other product list in the theme (collections, search, etc.). The real bug was in
  theme.css itself: .product-list--carousel (and its sm/md/sm-max/md-max variants) sets `grid` as a
  shorthand, which resets column-gap/row-gap to their initial value per spec - silently dropping the
  theme setting's value whenever this section runs in carousel mode. Fixed at the source (theme.css)
  instead of re-declaring the gap here, so the fix also applies to every other section that uses
  .product-list--carousel.
  {%- endcomment -%}

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .featured-product-list__scroll-controls {
    margin-top: var(--section-vertical-spacing);
  }

  /*
   * The prev/next controls (ScrollCarousel) align the target card with the snap alignment of the first
   * cell, and a promo block has none by default, which would make the whole carousel fall back to
   * centering. Setting "start" on both cards and promo keeps the next product flush with the left edge.
   */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} product-list .product-card,
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} product-list .product-list__promo {
    scroll-snap-align: start;
  }

  /*
   * ScrollCarousel computes where to scroll from each card's offsetLeft, which is measured from the nearest
   * positioned ancestor - the page itself when none is. The distance between the page edge and the carousel
   * (the section's side margin) was therefore added to every move, pushing the card that many pixels under
   * the left edge. Making the carousel its own positioned ancestor measures from its own edge instead.
   */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} product-list {
    position: relative;
  }

  {%- if section.settings.floating_product_list -%}
    {%- comment -%}
    Floating card: the products go edge to edge on the sides and the card has no padding at the top or at the bottom.
    The container's side margin (and the bleed distance derived from it, so the mobile carousel doesn't overshoot
    the card) and the top and bottom padding are removed.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .container {
      --distance-to-bleed: 0px;
      margin-inline: 0;
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .section-spacing {
      padding-block: 0;
    }
  {%- endif -%}

  @media screen and (min-width: 700px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
      --product-list-column-count: 2;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 1000px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
      --product-list-column-count: {{ section.settings.products_per_row_desktop }};
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="color-scheme color-scheme--{{ section.settings.color_scheme.id }}{% if section.settings.floating_product_list %} section-floating section-floating--block-end{% endif %}"{% if section.settings.floating_product_list %} style="border-radius: {{ section.settings.product_list_border_radius }}px {{ section.settings.product_list_border_radius }}px 0 0; overflow: hidden;"{% endif %}>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-spacing section-spacing--tight{% unless section.settings.floating_product_list %} section-spacing--outside{% endunless %}">
        {%- assign product_list_id = 'product-list-' | append: section.id -%}

        {%- liquid
          assign product_list_class = ''

          if section.settings.stack_products_mobile == false and section.settings.stack_products_desktop == false
            assign product_list_class = 'product-list--carousel scroll-area bleed md:unbleed'
          elsif section.settings.stack_products_mobile == false
            assign product_list_class = 'md-max:product-list--carousel scroll-area bleed md:unbleed'
          elsif section.settings.stack_products_desktop == false
            assign product_list_class = 'md:product-list--carousel scroll-area'
          endif
        -%}

        <product-list id="{{ product_list_id }}" cell-selector=".product-card, .product-list__promo" class="product-list {{ product_list_class }}" style="--product-card-border-radius: {{ section.settings.product_card_border_radius }}px;">
          {%- comment -%} Tablet divisor matches --product-list-column-count: 2 at the 700px breakpoint above, not products_per_row_desktop - keep in sync with that rule. {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- capture sizes -%}(max-width: 699px) calc(100vw / {{ section.settings.products_per_row_mobile }} - 40px), (max-width: 999px) calc(100vw / 2 - 64px), calc((100vw - 96px) / {{ section.settings.products_per_row_desktop }}){%- endcapture -%}

          {%- comment -%}
          Tracks the card's actual visual position in the grid (products AND promo blocks both occupy a
          cell), not just its index within product_list - product-card.liquid's own `position` param
          (which drives eager- vs lazy-loading its image) would otherwise undercount whenever a promo
          block is inserted before it.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign visual_position = 0 -%}

          {%- for product in section.settings.product_list -%}
            {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
              {%- if block.settings.position != forloop.parentloop.index -%}
                {%- continue -%}
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- assign visual_position = visual_position | plus: 1 -%}
              {%- assign promo_preload = false -%}
              {%- if section.index <= 3 and visual_position <= 3 -%}{%- assign promo_preload = true -%}{%- endif -%}
              {%- render 'product-list-promo', block: block, sizes: sizes, radius: section.settings.product_card_border_radius, preload: promo_preload -%}
            {%- endfor -%}

            {%- assign visual_position = visual_position | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- render 'product-card', product: product, reveal: true, sizes: sizes, position: visual_position -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
              {%- render 'product-card-placeholder', loop_index: i -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endfor -%}

          {%- comment -%}
          A block whose position is outside the 1..product_list.size range the main loop above matches
          against (beyond the last product, or - defensively, since a migrated/hand-edited template JSON
          could carry an out-of-range value the schema's min wouldn't otherwise allow - zero or negative)
          has no matching product to be inserted before, so it would never render there. We treat any such
          block as "show at the end" instead.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.settings.position >= 1 and block.settings.position <= section.settings.product_list.size -%}
              {%- continue -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- assign visual_position = visual_position | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- assign promo_preload = false -%}
            {%- if section.index <= 3 and visual_position <= 3 -%}{%- assign promo_preload = true -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- render 'product-list-promo', block: block, sizes: sizes, radius: section.settings.product_card_border_radius, preload: promo_preload -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </product-list>

        {%- comment -%}The scroll controls only make sense when the list scrolls, so each breakpoint shows them only in carousel mode, never when its products are stacked{%- endcomment -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign show_controls_mobile = false
          assign show_controls_desktop = false

          if section.settings.show_progress_bar_mobile and section.settings.stack_products_mobile == false
            assign show_controls_mobile = true
          endif

          if section.settings.show_progress_bar_desktop and section.settings.stack_products_desktop == false
            assign show_controls_desktop = true
          endif
        -%}

        {%- render 'scroll-controls', target_id: product_list_id, show_mobile: show_controls_mobile, show_desktop: show_controls_desktop, class: 'featured-product-list__scroll-controls' -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.featured_product_list.name",
  "class": "shopify-section--featured-product-list",
  "tag": "section",
  "disabled_on": {
    "templates": ["password"],
    "groups": ["header", "custom.overlay"]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:global.colors.scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "floating_product_list",
      "label": "Floating",
      "info": "Adds margins around the section (bottom and sides), using the store's global side margin.",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "product_list_border_radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 30,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Corner radius",
      "default": 0,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.floating_product_list }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "product_list",
      "id": "product_list",
      "label": "t:sections.featured_product_list.product_list"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "stack_products_mobile",
      "label": "t:global.product_list.stack_products_mobile",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "stack_products_desktop",
      "label": "t:global.product_list.stack_products_desktop",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Scroll controls"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_progress_bar_mobile",
      "label": "Show scroll controls on mobile",
      "info": "Only available in carousel mode (not when products are stacked).",
      "default": true,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.stack_products_mobile == false }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_progress_bar_desktop",
      "label": "Show scroll controls on desktop",
      "info": "Only available in carousel mode (not when products are stacked).",
      "default": false,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.stack_products_desktop == false }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "products_per_row_mobile",
      "label": "t:global.product_list.products_per_row_mobile",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "1",
          "label": "1"
        },
        {
          "value": "2",
          "label": "2"
        }
      ],
      "default": "1"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "products_per_row_desktop",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 4,
      "label": "t:global.product_list.products_per_row_desktop",
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "product_card_border_radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 25,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Radio del borde de la tarjeta de producto",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_quick_buy",
      "label": "t:theme_settings.product_card.show_quick_buy",
      "default": false
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "name": "t:sections.main_collection.blocks.image.name",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "t:sections.main_collection.blocks.image.info"
        },
        {
          "type": "color_scheme",
          "id": "color_scheme",
          "label": "t:global.colors.scheme",
          "default": "scheme-2"
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "position",
          "label": "t:sections.main_collection.blocks.general.position",
          "info": "t:sections.main_collection.blocks.general.position_info",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 50,
          "default": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "t:global.image.image",
          "info": "t:sections.main_collection.blocks.image.image_size_recommendation"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "mobile_image",
          "label": "t:global.image.mobile_image",
          "info": "t:sections.main_collection.blocks.image.mobile_image_size_recommendation"
        },
        {
          "type": "color",
          "id": "overlay_color",
          "label": "t:global.colors.image_overlay_color",
          "default": "#000000"
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "overlay_opacity",
          "label": "t:global.colors.image_overlay_opacity",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "step": 5,
          "unit": "%",
          "default": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "t:global.text.content"
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "content_position",
          "label": "t:global.position.content_position",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "place-self-start",
              "label": "t:global.position.top_left"
            },
            {
              "value": "place-self-start-center",
              "label": "t:global.position.top_center"
            },
            {
              "value": "place-self-start-end",
              "label": "t:global.position.top_right"
            },
            {
              "value": "place-self-center-start",
              "label": "t:global.position.middle_left"
            },
            {
              "value": "place-self-center",
              "label": "t:global.position.middle_center"
            },
